Procedure sum takes count as integer and variadic parameters returns integer:
    Start variadic arguments after count.
    Declare total as integer with value 0.
    For i from 1 to count:
        Add Next variadic argument as integer to total.
    End for.
    Finish variadic arguments.
    Return total.
End procedure.

Say Call sum with 3, 10, 20, 12 done.
